{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And I observed</b>. The extremities of the deeds of Elohim — I understood their essence. Therefore this evil deed that is done under the sun — I cannot understand it, because He has wearied their soul. And the wise of men labored to find the matter, and for this reason did not find it. And the meaning of בשל is like בעבור, thus <i>כי בשלי הסער הגדול</i> [for my sake the great storm]. And over this matter Job the righteous cried out."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:28:33.308901076Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}